---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import SiteHeader from "../../components/SiteHeader.astro";
import SiteFooter from "../../components/SiteFooter.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Riftbound Versus · Pocket Powered" description="A browser home for Riftbound: build decks, explore cards, practice against a bot, and challenge a friend. An independent project by Pocket Powered." image="/riftboundvs/arena.png" themeColor="#07121d">
  <SiteHeader />
  <main>
    <section class="rift-hero">
      <div class="shell hero-copy">
        <a class="back" href="/#work">← All projects</a>
        <p class="eyebrow">Pocket Powered / Riftbound Versus</p>
        <h1>The next match<br />is <em>one tab away.</em></h1>
        <p class="lede">A browser home for Riftbound. Build a deck, learn its lines, and put your next idea to the test.</p>
        <div class="actions"><a class="button button--yellow" href="https://riftboundvs.com">Play Riftbound Versus <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="#inside">Take a closer look ↓</a></div>
        <p class="availability">Live beta · Play in your browser · Best on desktop · Start as a guest</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="arena shell"><a href="/riftboundvs/arena.png" aria-label="Open full game board screenshot"><img src="/riftboundvs/arena.png" width="1280" height="720" alt="Riftbound Versus arena: two battlefields, a hand of cards, and a reaction chain showing a pending decision" fetchpriority="high" /></a><figcaption>The table, the hand, and the next decision — together in one view.</figcaption></figure>
    </section>
    <section class="intro shell" id="inside">
      <p class="eyebrow">From deck idea to game night</p>
      <h2>More time playing.<br />Less time setting up.</h2>
      <div class="features"><div><span>01 / Practice</span><h3>Find your next line.</h3><p>Jump into a bot match with a community deck. Explore the game before building a list of your own.</p></div><div><span>02 / Build</span><h3>Make the deck yours.</h3><p>Browse cards, choose your champion, and bring your ideas into the deck builder.</p></div><div><span>03 / Play</span><h3>Bring a friend.</h3><p>Take your deck into a match and play across the same shared battlefield, right from your browsers.</p></div></div>
    </section>
    <section class="product-section shell" aria-labelledby="catalog-title">
      <div class="section-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Know your cards</p><h2 id="catalog-title">The details<br />make the deck.</h2><p>Search the catalog by name, rules, or type. Filter by domain, set, and rarity, then inspect the printed rules without losing your place.</p></div>
      <figure><a href="/riftboundvs/card-detail.png"><img src="/riftboundvs/card-detail.png" width="1280" height="720" alt="Card library showing Ahri – Alluring, her printed rules, energy cost, power, and might" loading="lazy" /></a><figcaption>A searchable library, with the card and its rules side by side.</figcaption></figure>
    </section>
    <section class="product-section shell" aria-labelledby="builder-title"><div class="section-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Find your list</p><h2 id="builder-title">A deck, built<br />around your idea.</h2><p>Move from legend to champion, then fill out your cards, battlefields, and runes. Keep the deck summary and legality checks beside the catalog as you build.</p></div><figure><a href="/riftboundvs/deck-builder.png"><img src="/riftboundvs/deck-builder.png" width="1280" height="720" alt="Desktop deck builder with Ahri cards, a five-step sidebar, and a completed legal deck summary" loading="lazy" /></a><figcaption>Build and check your list without leaving the page.</figcaption></figure></section>
    <section class="tour shell" aria-labelledby="tour-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">A quick look around</p><h2 id="tour-title">Explore. Inspect. Build.</h2><p>A short tour through real product screens.</p></div><video controls loop muted playsinline preload="none" poster="/riftboundvs/cards.png" aria-label="Product screen tour showing the card library, card details, and deck builder"><source src="/riftboundvs/product-tour.mp4" type="video/mp4" />Your browser does not support video. <a href="/riftboundvs/product-tour.gif">View the animated screen tour.</a></video><a class="text-link" href="/riftboundvs/product-tour.gif">Open animated GIF ↗</a></section>
    <section class="craft shell"><p class="eyebrow">Designed, built, and shipped</p><h2>A card game is a system<br />of possibilities.</h2><p>I built Riftbound Versus to bring that system into the browser: a shared Kotlin game engine, a React interface, and the infrastructure that connects players at the table. The work spans rules modeling, card data, interaction design, and live multiplayer.</p><div class="stack"><span>Kotlin</span><span>React + TypeScript</span><span>Supabase</span><span>Multiplayer</span></div></section>
    <section class="closing shell"><h2>Got a deck idea?</h2><a class="button button--yellow" href="https://riftboundvs.com">Take it to the table <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><p>Riftbound Versus is an independent fan project, not affiliated with or endorsed by Riot Games. Riftbound, League of Legends, and their associated artwork belong to their respective owners.</p></section>
  </main>
  <SiteFooter />
</BaseLayout>
<style>
main {
  background: #07121d;
  color: #f7f1df;
}
.rift-hero {
  padding: 32px 0 64px;
  background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 65% 35%, #183c48 0, transparent 65%);
}
.back {
  color: #b4c3ca;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-size: 0.85rem;
}
.hero-copy {
  text-align: center;
}
.back {
  display: block;
  text-align: left;
  margin-bottom: 48px;
}
.eyebrow {
  color: #d4bd7b;
  font-size: 0.72rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.17em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  font-weight: 700;
}
h1 {
  font:
    400 clamp(3.2rem, 7vw, 6.3rem)/1.03 Georgia,
    serif;
  letter-spacing: -0.045em;
  margin: 24px 0;
}
h1 em {
  color: #d4bd7b;
  font-weight: 400;
}
.lede {
  font-size: 1.2rem;
  max-width: 540px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  color: #bccbd1;
}
.actions {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 28px;
  margin: 30px 0 18px;
}
.text-link {
  color: #d4bd7b;
  text-underline-offset: 5px;
}
.availability {
  color: #8fa4ae;
  font-size: 0.78rem;
}
.arena {
  margin-top: 48px;
  margin-inline: auto;
}
.arena img {
  height: auto;
  border: 1px solid #d4bd7b66;
  box-shadow: 0 30px 80px #0008;
  border-radius: 14px;
}
figure {
  margin: 0;
}
figcaption {
  color: #93a9b4;
  font-size: 0.8rem;
  margin-top: 14px;
  text-align: center;
}
.intro {
  padding-block: 92px;
}
.intro h2,
h2 {
  font:
    400 clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.4rem)/1.12 Georgia,
    serif;
  letter-spacing: -0.035em;
  margin: 16px 0 24px;
}
.features {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 40px;
  margin-top: 44px;
}
.features > div {
  border-top: 1px solid #d4bd7b44;
  padding-top: 22px;
}
.features span {
  color: #d4bd7b;
  font-size: 0.75rem;
}
.features h3 {
  font:
    400 1.55rem Georgia,
    serif;
}
.features p,
.section-copy > p:last-child,
.craft > p:not(.eyebrow),
.tour p:not(.eyebrow) {
  color: #b3c3cc;
  line-height: 1.75;
}
.product-section {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 0.65fr 1.35fr;
  gap: 48px;
  align-items: center;
  padding-block: 64px;
  border-top: 1px solid #ffffff18;
}
.product-section img,
.tour video {
  border: 1px solid #ffffff25;
  border-radius: 12px;
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;
}
.tour {
  padding-block: 64px;
  border-top: 1px solid #ffffff18;
}
.tour video {
  margin: 28px 0 16px;
}
.craft {
  padding-block: 72px;
  border-top: 1px solid #ffffff18;
}
.craft > p:not(.eyebrow) {
  max-width: 740px;
  font-size: 1.1rem;
}
.stack {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 10px;
  margin-top: 28px;
}
.stack span {
  font-size: 0.8rem;
  border: 1px solid #d4bd7b44;
  color: #d4bd7b;
  border-radius: 30px;
  padding: 6px 14px;
}
.closing {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 64px 0 80px;
}
.closing > p {
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  color: #839ba7;
  max-width: 670px;
  margin: 40px auto 0;
}
@media (max-width: 700px) {
  .actions {
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }
  .back {
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }
  .rift-hero {
    padding-bottom: 36px;
  }
  .arena {
    margin-top: 32px;
  }
  .intro,
  .craft {
    padding-block: 48px;
  }
  .features,
  .product-section {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 24px;
  }
  .features {
    gap: 28px;
  }
  .product-section,
  .tour {
    padding-block: 40px;
  }
  .closing {
    padding-block: 36px 56px;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: 3.4rem;
  }
  .lede {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }
  .arena img {
    border-radius: 8px;
  }
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  :global(html) {
    scroll-behavior: auto;
  }
}
</style>
